Some ideas were inspired by other mods, which include:
- [Inventory Management](https://modrinth.com/mod/inventory-management) and [Client Sort](https://modrinth.com/mod/clientsort) (fill stacks feature)
- [Quark](https://modrinth.com/mod/quark) (armor status and item count)

All management sounds are *not mine,* they are **Mojang's.** These include:
- The bundle noises
- The old opening/closing of door sounds (for locking slots)